---
// SEO Content Component - Helpful, human-first content with natural keyword integration
---

<section id="seo-content" class="seo-band" aria-labelledby="seo-headline">
  <div class="page-container seo-inner">
    <div class="seo-header">
      <span class="eyebrow">Free YouTube Video Downloader</span>
      <h2 id="seo-headline" class="display-lg seo-title">
        Download YouTube videos in <span class="text-gradient">MP4 & MP3</span> — free, fast, online.
      </h2>
      <p class="body-md seo-intro">
        mp4yt is a free online video downloader that works right in your browser. Paste a YouTube link and download the video as MP4 in up to 4K, or convert it to MP3 for audio-only. It also works with Instagram, TikTok, Twitter/X, Facebook, Reddit, and 1000+ other platforms. No app to install, no account to create, no files stored on our servers. Just paste, extract, and save.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="seo-grid">
      <div class="seo-card card">
        <div class="seo-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">🎬</div>
        <h3 class="display-sm seo-card-title">YouTube to MP4 Converter</h3>
        <p class="body-sm">
          Need to download a YouTube video as MP4? Paste the URL into mp4yt, click Extract, and get the direct download link in seconds. We support every resolution YouTube offers — 360p, 720p HD, 1080p Full HD, and 4K Ultra HD. Unlike other YouTube downloaders that re-encode your files, mp4yt delivers the original CDN stream directly, so quality is never lost.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="seo-card card">
        <div class="seo-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">💎</div>
        <h3 class="display-sm seo-card-title">4K Video Downloader — Full Quality</h3>
        <p class="body-sm">
          Why settle for blurry downloads? mp4yt is a video downloader that fetches the direct media stream from the platform's own CDN — no re-encoding, no compression, no quality loss. Whether you need 720p HD for your phone or 2160p 4K for a big screen, the original resolution is preserved. Ideal for saving tutorials, music videos, and cinematic content.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="seo-card card">
        <div class="seo-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">🎵</div>
        <h3 class="display-sm seo-card-title">YouTube to MP3 — Audio Extraction</h3>
        <p class="body-sm">
          Sometimes you only need the audio. mp4yt converts YouTube videos to MP3 so you can save podcasts, music, lectures, and audiobooks for offline listening. Just paste the YouTube link, select the audio option, and download the MP3 file. No separate YouTube to MP3 converter app needed — it's all built into one tool.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="seo-card card">
        <div class="seo-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">📱</div>
        <h3 class="display-sm seo-card-title">Works on iPhone, Android & PC</h3>
        <p class="body-sm">
          mp4yt is a fully responsive online video downloader that works in any browser — Safari, Chrome, Firefox, or Edge. Download YouTube videos on iPhone by saving to the Files app, or on Android where downloads start instantly. No app installation required, no storage wasted. One website works on every device.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="seo-card card">
        <div class="seo-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">⚡</div>
        <h3 class="display-sm seo-card-title">No App Needed — 100% Online</h3>
        <p class="body-sm">
          Most video downloader apps come bundled with adware or malware. mp4yt is different — it's a free video downloader that runs entirely in your browser. Our backend extracts the direct download URL and hands it to you. No background processes, no battery drain, no security risks. Paste a URL, click Extract, and download. That's it.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="seo-card card">
        <div class="seo-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">🌐</div>
        <h3 class="display-sm seo-card-title">1000+ Supported Platforms</h3>
        <p class="body-sm">
          mp4yt isn't just a YouTube downloader — it's a universal video downloader supporting 1000+ sites. Download Instagram Reels, TikTok videos without watermark, Twitter/X clips, Facebook videos, Reddit posts with audio, Vimeo, Twitch clips, SoundCloud tracks, and more. One URL bar handles every platform.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="seo-footer card">
      <h3 class="display-sm seo-footer-title">Why People Choose mp4yt</h3>
      <p class="body-md">
        Most YouTube downloaders make you sit through countdown timers, solve CAPTCHAs, or pay for premium subscriptions just to save a single video. mp4yt takes a different approach: paste a URL, click Extract, and download your video as MP4 or MP3. Our backend uses high-performance stream extraction to fetch direct media links from YouTube and 1000+ other platforms in milliseconds. We never store files on our servers, your privacy is fully protected, and the service is completely free — no hidden costs, no premium tiers, no download limits.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .seo-band {
    background-color: var(--color-canvas);
    padding: var(--sp-5xl) var(--sp-lg);
    border-top: var(--border);
    position: relative;
  }

  .seo-inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--sp-3xl);
  }

  .seo-header {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--sp-sm);
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .seo-title {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .text-gradient {
    color: var(--color-ink);
    background: none;
    -webkit-background-clip: unset;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: unset;
  }

  .seo-intro {
    color: var(--color-body);
    margin: var(--sp-xs) 0 0 0;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .seo-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    border: var(--border);
    background-color: var(--color-primary);
    gap: 2px;
  }

  .seo-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--sp-sm);
    background-color: var(--color-canvas);
    border: none;
    padding: var(--sp-xl);
    transition: background-color 0.1s ease;
  }

  .seo-card:hover {
    background-color: var(--color-canvas-soft-2);
    transform: none;
    box-shadow: none;
  }

  .seo-card-icon {
    font-size: 20px;
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background-color: var(--color-canvas-soft-2);
    border: var(--border);
    border-radius: 0px;
  }

  .seo-card-title {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .seo-card p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-body);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .seo-footer {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--sp-md);
    background-color: var(--color-canvas);
    border: var(--border);
    padding: var(--sp-xl);
  }

  .seo-footer-title {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .seo-footer p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-body);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  @media (max-width: 992px) {
    .seo-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .seo-band {
      padding: var(--sp-4xl) var(--sp-md);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .seo-band {
      padding: var(--sp-3xl) var(--sp-sm);
    }
    .seo-card {
      padding: var(--sp-md);
    }
    .seo-footer {
      padding: var(--sp-md);
    }
    .seo-card p,
    .seo-footer p {
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .seo-intro {
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
  }
</style>
